      "selector": ".sqs-html-content (index 0)",
      "html": "<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Sunset Waves:</strong> Sunsets and rolling ocean waves are a combination older than man himself. Our waters have seen the evolution of species, the growth of mankind and the fall of civilizations one sunset at a time. But for every sunset that dips below the aqua horizon lies a sunrise reaching for a new day somewhere else in the world. It's a reminder that something that's given away is taken from somewhere else. </p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\">24” X 36” Mixed media acrylic painting with organic plaster base layer on gallery wrapped canvas. Ready to hand.</span></p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--black\">Sold</span></p></div>",
